; FILED: an internal `define` followed by ANY further body form loses its slot
; on the VM. compile_form_define() leaves the value on the stack AND registers
; it as a local at that slot, but the body sequencer then emits OP_POP for the
; non-final expression, popping the variable's own slot.
; native -r : 7
; vm        : ()
; Independent of the named-let capture class (corpus/36_set_from_named_let.esk)
; — it reproduces with a plain `let` as the following form, and the `do` variant
; ((define acc 7) (do ((i 0 (+ i 1))) ((= i 2))) acc) spins forever.
(define (f) (define acc 7) (let ((x 1)) x) acc)
(display (f))
(newline)
